    "GEOIP,CN 和 GEOSITE,cn 没有订阅自带的规则集时，使用公开列表（gaoyifan/china-operator-ip、Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat），由内核每天直连下载一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the subscription has no rule set for GEOIP,CN or GEOSITE,cn, public lists (gaoyifan/china-operator-ip, Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat) are used; the engine downloads them directly once a day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GEOIP,CN 和 GEOSITE,cn 沒有訂閱自帶的規則集時，使用公開清單（gaoyifan/china-operator-ip、Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat），由核心每天直連下載一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
