          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Imported"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入带规则和策略组的订阅（Clash、Surge、Loon 配置）后，可以在这里按订阅规则分流和切换策略组。现在全部流量走所选节点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you import a subscription with rules and policy groups (a Clash, Surge or Loon profile), you can route by its rules and switch its policy groups here. Right now all traffic goes through the selected node."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入帶規則和策略組的訂閱（Clash、Surge、Loon 設定）後，可以在這裡按訂閱規則分流和切換策略組。現在全部流量走所選節點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入插件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import Plugin"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入外掛"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入新节点会替换当前节点。多节点、订阅和策略组会在内核支持后开放。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importing a new node replaces the current one. Multiple nodes, subscriptions and policy groups will open up once the core supports them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入新節點會替換目前節點。多節點、訂閱和策略組會在核心支援後開放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
