    "延迟为经该节点请求 `http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204` 的 HTTP 真连接时间，5 秒无响应显示超时。连接中切换节点会自动重连。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delay is the time for a real HTTP request to `http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204` through the node; no answer in 5 seconds shows Timeout. Switching nodes while connected reconnects automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "延遲為經該節點請求 `http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204` 的 HTTP 真連線時間，5 秒無回應顯示逾時。連線中切換節點會自動重連。"
          }
        }
      }
