      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By host"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按主機"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按域名和 IP 分流、规则集和规则测试会放在这里。当前版本按节点配置转发全部流量。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Routing by domain and IP, rule sets and rule testing will live here. This version sends all traffic through the node."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按網域和 IP 分流、規則集和規則測試會放在這裡。目前版本按節點設定轉發全部流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按小时": {
      "localizations": {
