          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按延迟排序，未测速的节点在后。连接中切换节点会自动重连。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sorted by delay, untested nodes last. Switching while connected reconnects automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按延遲排序，未測速的節點在後。連線中切換節點會自動重連。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
