    "按订阅规则和策略组分流。连接中切换立即生效，已有连接会重新建立。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Routes by the subscription's rules and policy groups. Switching while connected takes effect at once; open connections reconnect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按訂閱規則和策略組分流。連線中切換立即生效，已有連線會重新建立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部流量走代理页选中的节点。连接中切换立即生效，已有连接会重新建立。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends everything through the node selected on the Proxies page. Switching while connected takes effect at once; open connections reconnect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部流量走代理頁選中的節點。連線中切換立即生效，已有連線會重新建立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部流量直连，不经过代理节点。连接中切换立即生效，已有连接会重新建立。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends everything directly, without a proxy node. Switching while connected takes effect at once; open connections reconnect."
