          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法將閘道模式儲存到 VPN 設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把这台 Mac 当作网关": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use This Mac as a Gateway"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把這台 Mac 當作閘道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设备的路由器填": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Router on the Device"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置的路由器填"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设备的 DNS 填": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DNS on the Device"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置的 DNS 填"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有连上局域网": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not on a local network"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有連上區域網路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IP 转发": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IP Forwarding"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IP 轉送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已开启": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未开启": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制命令": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy Command"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷貝指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网关模式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gateway Mode"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閘道模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网关模式要用 VPN 接管流量，“仅系统代理”下不能开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gateway mode needs the VPN to take traffic; it is not available with System Proxy Only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閘道模式要用 VPN 接管流量，「僅系統代理」下不能開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，同一局域网的设备（游戏机、电视、手机）把路由器和 DNS 改成上面的地址，它们的流量就经过这台 Mac 按规则走，MITM、抓包和连接列表同样生效。需要 IPv4 转发：连接时会尝试自动开启、断开时关闭；系统不允许时，在“终端”里运行一次上面的命令（重启 Mac 后失效）。只支持 IPv4；单个 WireGuard 节点不支持。切换时如果已连接，会自动重连一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, devices on the same local network (consoles, TVs, phones) that set their router and DNS to the addresses above send their traffic through this Mac by the rules, with MITM, capture and the connection list. It needs IPv4 forwarding: connecting tries to turn it on and disconnecting turns it off; if the system does not allow that, run the command above once in Terminal (it lasts until the Mac restarts). IPv4 only; a single WireGuard node is not supported. If connected, switching reconnects once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟後，同一區域網路的裝置（遊戲機、電視、手機）把路由器和 DNS 改成上面的位址，它們的流量就經過這台 Mac 按規則走，MITM、封包擷取和連線列表同樣生效。需要 IPv4 轉送：連線時會嘗試自動開啟、中斷時關閉；系統不允許時，在「終端機」裡執行一次上面的指令（重新啟動 Mac 後失效）。只支援 IPv4；單個 WireGuard 節點不支援。切換時如果已連線，會自動重新連線一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有规则命中的域名由默认服务器解析。长按服务器可设为默认、加入默认竞速（最多 4 个同时查询，取最先的应答）或设为备用（默认或规则的服务器失败时再查，适合公司 VPN 的内部域名）。经代理的服务器在直连模式下也直连，系统 DNS 总是直连。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Names no rule picks go to the default servers. Long-press a server to make it the default, add it to the default race (up to 4 asked at once, the first answer wins) or make it the fallback (asked when the default or a rule's servers fail, as for a company VPN's internal names). Servers set to go through the proxy go directly in direct mode; the system DNS always goes directly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有規則命中的網域由預設伺服器解析。長按伺服器可設為預設、加入預設競速（最多 4 個同時查詢，取最先的回應）或設為備用（預設或規則的伺服器失敗時再查，適合公司 VPN 的內部網域）。經代理的伺服器在直連模式下也直連，系統 DNS 一律直連。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地址可写 1.1.1.1、udp://、tcp://、tls://（DoT）、https://（DoH）、quic://（DoQ），或 system（本机网络的 DNS）。用 IP 地址写 DoT/DoH/DoQ 时填写证书上的 TLS 名称。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter 1.1.1.1, udp://, tcp://, tls:// (DoT), https:// (DoH), quic:// (DoQ), or system (the local network's DNS). For DoT/DoH/DoQ by IP address, enter the TLS name on the certificate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位址可寫 1.1.1.1、udp://、tcp://、tls://（DoT）、https://（DoH）、quic://（DoQ），或 system（本機網路的 DNS）。用 IP 位址寫 DoT/DoH/DoQ 時填寫憑證上的 TLS 名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地址应为 IP、system，或 udp://、tcp://、tls://、https://、quic:// 开头": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address must be an IP or system, or start with udp://, tcp://, tls://, https:// or quic://"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位址應為 IP、system，或 udp://、tcp://、tls://、https://、quic:// 開頭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "加入默认竞速": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add to default race"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加入預設競速"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出默认竞速": {
      "localizations": {
